Project Description:
A web-based Trading Strategy Simulator that allows users to simulate market data and analyze trading strategies using technical indicators.

Features:
• Generate simulated market datasets
• Visualize market trends using interactive charts
• Test moving average and RSI-based trading strategies
• Analyze trading performance using simulated data
• User-friendly and responsive interface

Technologies Used:
Frontend: React, Vite
Backend: Node.js, Express.js
Deployment: Vercel
Version Control: Git & GitHub

